    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, dudes, let's go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, it's not like any of you know what I'm saying, but show 'em what you got~!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aha! I wasn't sure about this at first, but it's kinda fun taking these guys around to fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Utage, are you out of your mind? What are you even doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, it's Gavial. Croissant and Doctor too! Heyas!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's heying ya?! Why are you attacking the village, and where'd you get these guys?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Is this your hometown? Alright, I'll knock it off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get these fellers to knock it off too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, but, you know, they don't understand a word I say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch... Looks like we're out of options. Let's take these idiots down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
